WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.703 --> 00:00:10.783
Not sure what to train? Start from a ready-made program, and RepBunny sets up every routine for you.

2
00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:12.094
Here's how.

3
00:00:12.449 --> 00:00:15.569
On Home, tap Start from a program.

4
00:00:15.922 --> 00:00:20.722
Pick the one that fits your week. Let's go with push, pull, legs.

5
00:00:21.079 --> 00:00:25.879
It shows the routines it will add. Tap the Add 3 routines button.

6
00:00:26.281 --> 00:00:29.881
Back on Home, your three new routines are ready to start.
